{"pages":[{"h":792,"segs":[["CRUCIAL ELEMENTS",151.90000000000001,33.840599999999995,507.74000000000001,116.00059999999996,80,false],["OF A SMALL GROUP",151.90000000000001,93.840599999999995,496.46000000000004,176.00059999999996,80,false],["GROUPS THAT CHANGE LIVES",151.90000000000001,166.78059999999994,430.51999999999998,193.10059999999999,20,false],["Though groups may include a variety of members,",146.40000000000001,225.43489999999986,334.923,237.8368999999999,9,false],["personalities, and people, from a wide range of",146.40000000000001,238.43089999999984,321.83699999999999,250.83289999999988,9,false],["backgrounds, there are some elements which",146.40000000000001,251.42689999999982,316.9860000000001,263.82889999999986,9,false],["characterize every effective Christian small group.",146.40000000000001,264.4228999999998,337.47899999999998,276.82489999999984,9,false],["A prospering small group will have each of these",146.40000000000001,277.41889999999989,328.68600000000015,289.82089999999988,9,false],["elements: Christ-centered focus, community, each",146.40000000000001,290.41489999999988,337.26300000000003,302.81689999999986,9,false],["person richly experiencing Christ, progressive",146.40000000000001,303.41089999999986,322.125,315.81289999999984,9,false],["life-change and outward impact.",146.40000000000001,316.40689999999984,269.37599999999998,328.80889999999982,9,false],["COMMUNITY",370.20000000000005,227.46010000000001,427.08000000000004,248.00009999999997,20,false],["Community is the sense within the group that",370.20000000000005,247.07509999999991,543.61200000000008,259.47709999999995,9,false],["members are a team, bonded together as friends and",370.20000000000005,260.07109999999989,567.29100000000017,272.47309999999993,9,false],["committed to each other’s well-being and growth.",370.20000000000005,273.06709999999998,557.49900000000002,285.46909999999997,9,false],["This doesn’t happen all at once, but healthy, growing",370.20000000000005,286.06309999999996,567.93000000000006,298.46509999999995,9,false],["groups have an increasing sense of community. Over",370.20000000000005,299.05909999999994,568.40700000000004,311.46109999999993,9,false],["time, individuals rejoice together, and share in sorrow",370.20000000000005,312.05509999999992,574.23000000000002,324.45709999999991,9,false],["together. These groups move from being “Tom’s",370.20000000000005,325.05109999999991,550.25400000000013,337.45309999999989,9,false],["group” to “our group,” as members begin to take",370.20000000000005,338.04709999999989,549.49800000000027,350.44909999999987,9,false],["ownership of the group. The leader can help facilitate",370.20000000000005,351.04309999999987,571.70100000000014,363.44509999999985,9,false],["this, but community is not primarily a leadership",370.20000000000005,364.03909999999985,555.58200000000011,376.44109999999984,9,false],["issue. Rather, it’s a oneness that becomes apparent",370.20000000000005,377.03509999999983,561.45900000000006,389.43709999999982,9,false],["when individuals come to value others in the group.",370.20000000000005,390.03109999999981,564.90600000000018,402.4330999999998,9,false],["Chapter 6 will give you insight into understanding",370.20000000000005,403.02709999999979,559.90200000000016,415.42909999999978,9,false],["community and some ideas on how to nurture this in",370.20000000000005,416.02309999999977,569.49600000000009,428.42509999999976,9,false],["your group.",370.20000000000005,429.01909999999975,413.32800000000003,441.42109999999974,9,false],["QUALITY BIBLICAL CONTENT",146.40000000000001,452.81989999999996,271.39999999999998,473.35989999999998,20,false],["This might come as a surprise, but small group Bible",146.40000000000001,472.43489999999997,343.98600000000005,484.83689999999996,9,false],["studies study the Bible. Central to the Christian faith",146.40000000000001,485.43089999999995,346.30800000000016,497.83289999999994,9,false],["is the belief that God has revealed Himself to us in",146.40000000000001,498.42689999999993,335.49000000000012,510.82889999999992,9,false],["His Word. But the ultimate goal of studying the Bible",146.40000000000001,511.42289999999991,345.4980000000001,523.82489999999984,9,false],["together is to point the group to Christ, not to view",146.40000000000001,524.41889999999989,337.01100000000008,536.82089999999994,9,false],["Bible knowledge as an end in itself, but to see the Bible",146.40000000000001,537.41489999999988,351.69900000000007,549.81689999999992,9,false],["as a map that leads us to Christ.",146.40000000000001,550.41089999999986,265.51499999999999,562.8128999999999,9,false],["C R U C I A L",43.841199999999994,638.93820000000005,57.071199999999997,672.35619999999994,7,false],["E L E M E N TS",43.841199999999994,596.51120000000003,57.071200000000005,635.96320000000003,7,false],["O F",43.841200000000001,583.18320000000006,57.071200000000005,593.53620000000001,7,false],["A S M A L L",43.841200000000001,548.0222,57.071200000000005,580.20820000000003,7,false],["G RO U P 1",43.841200000000001,509.49989999999997,57.071200000000005,545.04719999999998,9,false],["EACH PERSON RICHLY EXPERIENCING CHRIST",370.20000000000005,461.46010000000001,571.46000000000004,482.00010000000003,20,false],["As a leader your role is to stimulate group members",370.20000000000005,481.07510000000002,564.34799999999996,493.47710000000001,9,false],["to encounter and experience Christ for themselves.",370.20000000000005,494.0711,563.88900000000012,506.47309999999999,9,false],["One of the most intimidating things that a small group",370.20000000000005,507.06709999999998,575.01300000000015,519.46910000000003,9,false],["leader faces is thinking that they have to have all",370.20000000000005,520.06309999999996,552.90900000000011,532.46509999999989,9,false],["the answers – the “map” memorized. Leaders don’t",370.20000000000005,533.05909999999994,562.29600000000005,545.46109999999999,9,false],["need to have all the answers, but they do need to be",370.20000000000005,546.05510000000004,561.65700000000015,558.45709999999997,9,false],["experiencing Christ for themselves and know how",370.20000000000005,559.05109999999991,560.16300000000001,571.45309999999995,9,false],["to point others to Him. This comes from knowing",370.20000000000005,572.0471,556.59000000000015,584.44910000000004,9,false],["people’s greatest needs, having an understanding of",370.20000000000005,585.04309999999998,564.58200000000011,597.44510000000002,9,false],["how real change happens and being skilled at asking",370.20000000000005,598.03909999999996,566.88600000000008,610.44110000000001,9,false],["good questions that engage the heart.",370.20000000000005,611.03510000000006,510.60000000000002,623.43709999999999,9,false],["Your group needs to experience Christ, not just learn",146.40000000000001,576.41189999999983,345.75000000000006,588.81389999999988,9,false],["more about the Bible, as valuable as that is. In no",146.40000000000001,589.40789999999993,329.46900000000016,601.80989999999997,9,false],["way do we want to move away from the Bible – it is",146.40000000000001,602.40389999999991,336.99300000000011,614.80589999999995,9,false],["the Word of God – but as you study the Scripture you",146.40000000000001,615.39989999999989,345.29100000000011,627.80189999999993,9,false],["want to help your group to see the person to whom the",146.40000000000001,628.39589999999998,350.43900000000014,640.79789999999991,9,false],["Scriptures point, that is Jesus. This is not to look to",146.40000000000001,641.39189999999996,340.05300000000011,653.79389999999989,9,false],["find Jesus in every text but to look to discover how the",146.40000000000001,654.38789999999995,350.39400000000006,666.78989999999999,9,false],["text relates and points to Christ and his redemptive",146.40000000000001,667.38389999999993,340.60199999999998,679.78589999999997,9,false],["work.",146.40000000000001,680.37989999999991,167.95500000000001,692.78189999999995,9,false],["You want each person in your group to taste, see,",370.20000000000005,637.03610000000003,553.13400000000001,649.43810000000008,9,false],["and personally encounter Christ as you come to the",370.20000000000005,650.03210000000001,564.24900000000014,662.43410000000006,9,false],["Scriptures.",370.20000000000005,663.02809999999999,412.46400000000006,675.43010000000004,9,false],["PROGRESSIVE LIFE-CHANGE",370.20000000000005,695.46010000000001,493.98000000000002,716.00009999999997,20,false],["© 2010, CruPress, All Rights Reserved. CruPress.com",204.23800660000001,766.03521969999997,407.76400660000002,778.43721970000001,9,false]],"w":612,"ocr":false},{"h":792,"ocr":false,"w":612,"segs":[["C R U C I A L",43.841199999999994,639.73019999999997,57.071199999999997,673.14819999999997,7,false],["E L E M E N TS",43.841199999999994,597.30320000000006,57.071200000000005,636.75520000000006,7,false],["O F",43.841200000000001,583.97520000000009,57.071200000000005,594.32820000000004,7,false],["A S M A L L",43.841200000000001,548.81420000000003,57.071200000000005,581.00020000000006,7,false],["G RO U P 2",43.841200000000001,509.49990000000003,57.071200000000005,545.83919999999989,9,false],["Successful small groups are about life-change. On",146.40000000000001,33.434899999999857,334.6350000000001,45.836899999999901,9,false],["the road trip of life, we all hit potholes, dead ends,",146.40000000000001,46.430899999999838,332.79000000000008,58.832899999999881,9,false],["construction zones, and pileups – sometimes twenty",146.40000000000001,59.426899999999819,345.0390000000001,71.828899999999862,9,false],["cars or more. As a result of the wear-and-tear brought",146.40000000000001,72.4228999999998,349.21500000000015,84.824899999999843,9,false],["on by life’s challenges, each week the members of",146.40000000000001,85.41889999999978,331.95300000000009,97.820899999999824,9,false],["your group show up in less than showroom condition,",146.40000000000001,98.414899999999761,348.52200000000016,110.81689999999981,9,false],["sometimes in need of some serious bodywork. Their",146.40000000000001,111.41089999999974,343.37400000000002,123.81289999999979,9,false],["condition may be obvious, or not so obvious.",146.40000000000001,124.40689999999972,312.87300000000005,136.80889999999977,9,false],["As a leader (in need of your own bodywork, of course)",146.40000000000001,150.4078999999997,348.16200000000003,162.80989999999974,9,false],["you want to allow the Scriptures to expose our",146.40000000000001,163.40389999999968,320.89200000000005,175.80589999999972,9,false],["brokenness and then follow the passage as it points",146.40000000000001,176.39989999999966,339.65700000000015,188.8018999999997,9,false],["toward a solution and ultimately to a person, Jesus",146.40000000000001,189.39589999999964,338.10900000000009,201.79789999999969,9,false],["Christ. This is how life-change happens. If a group",146.40000000000001,202.39189999999962,336.33600000000001,214.79389999999967,9,false],["stops short of being a catalyst for life-change, it has",146.40000000000001,215.3878999999996,339.68400000000008,227.78989999999965,9,false],["fallen short of all God intends for the group.",146.40000000000001,228.38389999999958,310.83000000000004,240.78589999999963,9,false],["•",370.20000000000005,33.434899999999857,374.34000000000003,45.836899999999901,9,false],["•",370.20000000000005,46.434899999999857,374.34000000000003,58.836899999999901,9,false],["•",370.20000000000005,59.434899999999857,374.34000000000003,71.836899999999901,9,false],["Discipleship",388.20000000000005,33.434899999999857,436.19700000000006,45.836899999999901,9,false],["Compassion for the Lost",388.20000000000005,46.434899999999857,481.32300000000004,58.836899999999901,9,false],["Spiritual Battle",388.20000000000005,59.434899999999857,446.88000000000011,71.836899999999901,9,false],["TRAINING",370.20000000000005,91.819899999999961,413.30000000000007,112.35989999999993,20,false],["Another element for your small group is training.",370.20000000000005,111.43489999999986,555.69900000000018,123.8368999999999,9,false],["Share practical, helpful, specific things about how to",370.20000000000005,124.43089999999984,567.99300000000017,136.83289999999988,9,false],["live and minister to others. How do you have a Quiet",370.20000000000005,137.42689999999982,566.6880000000001,149.82889999999986,9,false],["Time? How do you study the Bible? Can you share",370.20000000000005,150.4228999999998,557.87700000000018,162.82489999999984,9,false],["Christ comfortably with a friend? How do you answer",370.20000000000005,163.41889999999978,573.12300000000005,175.82089999999982,9,false],["someone’s questions about Christianity? Can you",370.20000000000005,176.41489999999976,557.22000000000014,188.81689999999981,9,false],["share your testimony in three minutes? If someone",370.20000000000005,189.41089999999974,563.19600000000014,201.81289999999979,9,false],["did trust Christ with you how would you help him or",370.20000000000005,202.40689999999972,567.34500000000014,214.80889999999977,9,false],["her grow? Help your students develop the skills they",370.20000000000005,215.4028999999997,567.6690000000001,227.80489999999975,9,false],["need to effectively address situations like these:",370.20000000000005,228.39889999999968,550.58699999999999,240.80089999999973,9,false],["OUTWARD IMPACT",146.40000000000001,260.81989999999996,228.02000000000001,281.35989999999998,20,false],["One thing that’s often neglected in small groups is",146.40000000000001,280.43489999999997,334.71600000000001,292.83689999999996,9,false],["communicating an increasing sense of God’s purpose",146.40000000000001,293.43089999999995,347.40600000000006,305.83289999999994,9,false],["for the world and how we fit in the picture. Content",146.40000000000001,306.42689999999993,339.45900000000012,318.82889999999992,9,false],["is not the only ingredient needed for our growth.",146.40000000000001,319.42289999999991,328.89300000000009,331.8248999999999,9,false],["Knowing how God can use us in His plan is a critical",146.40000000000001,332.41889999999989,343.21200000000022,344.82089999999988,9,false],["ingredient. Catching His heart for people around the",146.40000000000001,345.41489999999988,344.66100000000006,357.81689999999986,9,false],["world is motivating.",146.40000000000001,358.41089999999986,222.29699999999997,370.81289999999984,9,false],["His love moves us to action. We’re not here merely for",146.40000000000001,384.41189999999983,349.15200000000004,396.81389999999982,9,false],["theory, debate or platitudes. We exist to glorify God",146.40000000000001,397.40789999999981,339.68400000000008,409.8098999999998,9,false],["and be used by Him. Sometimes when we share our",146.40000000000001,410.40389999999979,339.90900000000005,422.80589999999978,9,false],["faith there’s an overwhelming sense that “God can use",146.40000000000001,423.39989999999977,350.62800000000004,435.80189999999976,9,false],["me!” How do you build vision in your group? Here are",146.40000000000001,436.39589999999976,347.37900000000002,448.79789999999974,9,false],["some suggestions: Highlight sections from a visionary",146.40000000000001,449.39189999999974,350.48400000000004,461.79389999999972,9,false],["book or magazine like:",146.40000000000001,462.38789999999972,230.83800000000002,474.7898999999997,9,false],["•",146.40000000000001,488.43490000000003,150.54000000000002,500.83690000000001,9,false],["•",146.40000000000001,501.43490000000003,150.54000000000002,513.83690000000001,9,false],["•",146.40000000000001,514.43489999999997,150.54000000000002,526.83690000000001,9,false],["•",146.40000000000001,527.43489999999997,150.54000000000002,539.83690000000001,9,false],["•",146.40000000000001,540.43489999999997,150.54000000000002,552.83690000000001,9,false],["•",146.40000000000001,553.43489999999997,150.54000000000002,565.83690000000001,9,false],["•",146.40000000000001,566.43489999999997,150.54000000000002,578.83690000000001,9,false],["•",146.40000000000001,579.43489999999997,150.54000000000002,591.83690000000001,9,false],["•",146.40000000000001,592.43489999999997,150.54000000000002,604.83690000000001,9,false],["Master Plan of Evangelism",164.40000000000001,488.43490000000003,266.73900000000003,500.83690000000001,9,false],["Tell It Often Tell It Well",164.40000000000001,501.43490000000003,255.26400000000001,513.83690000000001,9,false],["Disciple Are Made Not Born",166.00200000000001,514.43489999999997,273.16500000000002,526.83690000000001,9,false],["Hudson Taylor’s Spiritual Secrets",164.40000000000001,527.43489999999997,292.78500000000008,539.83690000000001,9,false],["In the Gap",164.40000000000001,540.43489999999997,204.18000000000001,552.83690000000001,9,false],["Spiritual Leadership",164.40000000000001,553.43489999999997,243.267,565.83690000000001,9,false],["Discipleship Journal articles",164.40000000000001,566.43489999999997,274.38000000000005,578.83690000000001,9,false],["Becoming a Contagious Christian",164.40000000000001,579.43489999999997,292.137,591.83690000000001,9,false],["Use the Operation World prayer book and a map",164.40000000000001,592.43489999999997,346.2000000000001,604.83690000000001,9,false],["to show what God’s doing around the world.",164.40000000000001,605.43090000000007,329.54100000000005,617.8329,9,false],["Or you can discuss a passage related to one of these",146.40000000000001,631.43190000000004,339.36900000000003,643.83389999999997,9,false],["topics:",146.40000000000001,644.42790000000002,171.78900000000002,656.82989999999995,9,false],["•",146.40000000000001,670.43489999999997,150.54000000000002,682.83690000000001,9,false],["•",146.40000000000001,683.43489999999997,150.54000000000002,695.83690000000001,9,false],["Evangelism",164.40000000000001,670.43489999999997,209.22,682.83690000000001,9,false],["Faith",164.40000000000001,683.43489999999997,184.74000000000001,695.83690000000001,9,false],["•",146.40000000000001,696.43489999999997,150.54000000000002,708.83690000000001,9,false],["•",146.40000000000001,709.43489999999997,150.54000000000002,721.83690000000001,9,false],["Prayer",164.40000000000001,696.43489999999997,189.93299999999999,708.83690000000001,9,false],["Worship",164.40000000000001,709.43489999999997,197.45699999999999,721.83690000000001,9,false],["•",370.20000000000005,254.43489999999986,374.34000000000003,266.8368999999999,9,false],["•",370.20000000000005,267.43489999999986,374.34000000000003,279.8368999999999,9,false],["•",370.20000000000005,280.43489999999997,374.34000000000003,292.83689999999996,9,false],["•",370.20000000000005,293.43489999999997,374.34000000000003,305.83689999999996,9,false],["•",370.20000000000005,306.43489999999997,374.34000000000003,318.83689999999996,9,false],["•",370.20000000000005,319.43489999999997,374.34000000000003,331.83689999999996,9,false],["•",370.20000000000005,332.43489999999997,374.34000000000003,344.83689999999996,9,false],["•",370.20000000000005,345.43489999999997,374.34000000000003,357.83689999999996,9,false],["•",370.20000000000005,358.43489999999997,374.34000000000003,370.83689999999996,9,false],["•",370.20000000000005,371.43489999999997,374.34000000000003,383.83689999999996,9,false],["Using the Four Spiritual Laws.",388.20000000000005,254.43489999999986,504.04800000000006,266.8368999999999,9,false],["Communicating the role of the Holy Spirit.",388.20000000000005,267.43489999999986,550.17300000000023,279.8368999999999,9,false],["Following up new believers.",388.20000000000005,280.43489999999997,493.59900000000005,292.83689999999996,9,false],["Sharing personal testimonies.",388.20000000000005,293.43489999999997,501.88800000000003,305.83689999999996,9,false],["Using evangelistic tools and apologetics",388.20000000000005,306.43489999999997,539.31000000000017,318.83689999999996,9,false],["Planning and running retreats and conferences.",388.20000000000005,319.43489999999997,568.92000000000007,331.83689999999996,9,false],["Recruiting for projects.",388.20000000000005,332.43489999999997,476.64300000000003,344.83689999999996,9,false],["Motivating others from the Word.",388.20000000000005,345.43489999999997,516.31500000000005,357.83689999999996,9,false],["Leading a small group.",388.20000000000005,358.43489999999997,473.17800000000011,370.83689999999996,9,false],["Explaining how to know God’s will for your life.",388.20000000000005,371.43489999999997,566.99400000000014,383.83689999999996,9,false],["PRAYER",370.20000000000005,403.81989999999996,405.32000000000005,424.35989999999998,20,false],["Prayer is an expression of our dependence upon God.",370.20000000000005,423.43489999999997,570.32400000000007,435.83689999999996,9,false],["You’ll help people see their need to depend",370.20000000000005,436.43089999999995,530.80500000000006,448.83289999999994,9,false],["upon Him. Most small groups have time set aside for",370.20000000000005,449.42689999999993,568.39800000000014,461.82889999999992,9,false],["prayer, but often it’s a quick sharing of requests for the",370.20000000000005,462.42289999999991,575.37300000000005,474.8248999999999,9,false],["week. Creativity is the element most needed in prayer.",370.20000000000005,475.41889999999989,574.83300000000008,487.82089999999988,9,false],["Sometimes you need to ask, “How has God answered",370.20000000000005,488.41489999999988,568.90200000000004,500.81689999999986,9,false],["prayer this week? What are you trusting Him for?”",370.20000000000005,501.41089999999986,560.71199999999999,513.8128999999999,9,false],["when students in your group see God’s answers to",370.20000000000005,514.40689999999984,558.10200000000009,526.80889999999977,9,false],["prayer they get pumped. When you pray together a",370.20000000000005,527.40289999999982,560.41500000000019,539.80489999999986,9,false],["powerful bond in the group forms.",370.20000000000005,540.39889999999991,498.90000000000009,552.80089999999984,9,false],["It’s also important to pray for other people, issues and",370.20000000000005,566.39989999999989,572.98800000000006,578.80189999999982,9,false],["events outside your small group. Here are some other",370.20000000000005,579.39589999999987,571.14300000000003,591.7978999999998,9,false],["things to consider for prayer:",370.20000000000005,592.39189999999985,479.77500000000009,604.79389999999989,9,false],["•",370.20000000000005,618.43489999999997,374.34000000000003,630.83690000000001,9,false],["•",370.20000000000005,631.43489999999997,374.34000000000003,643.83690000000001,9,false],["•",370.20000000000005,644.43489999999997,374.34000000000003,656.83690000000001,9,false],["•",370.20000000000005,657.43489999999997,374.34000000000003,669.83690000000001,9,false],["•",370.20000000000005,670.43489999999997,374.34000000000003,682.83690000000001,9,false],["•",370.20000000000005,683.43489999999997,374.34000000000003,695.83690000000001,9,false],["•",370.20000000000005,696.43489999999997,374.34000000000003,708.83690000000001,9,false],["Application of the vision time.",388.20000000000005,618.43489999999997,502.80600000000004,630.83690000000001,9,false],["Application of the Bible study topic.",388.20000000000005,631.43489999999997,523.9380000000001,643.83690000000001,9,false],["Worship (songs, Psalms, etc.).",388.20000000000005,644.43489999999997,500.78100000000006,656.83690000000001,9,false],["Up-coming events.",388.20000000000005,657.43489999999997,459.71400000000006,669.83690000000001,9,false],["Personal ministry development.",388.20000000000005,670.43489999999997,509.85300000000007,682.83690000000001,9,false],["Laborers for the harvest.",388.20000000000005,683.43489999999997,481.79100000000005,695.83690000000001,9,false],["Ministry leaders.",388.20000000000005,696.43489999999997,453.32400000000007,708.83690000000001,9,false],["© 2010, CruPress, All Rights Reserved. CruPress.com",204.23800660000001,766.03521969999997,407.76400660000002,778.43721970000001,9,false]]}]}